Five games, the smallest week of the season, and the trade tracker.

3
00:00:08.119 --> 00:00:08.802
Let's go!

4
00:00:09.852 --> 00:00:17.617
We go live to Monday night! Tom has finished on 109.34. Jake needs 17.75 from Brock Purdy.

5
