16
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.656
Christian McCaffrey, 30.70. The only 30 of the week!

17
00:01:04.736 --> 00:01:08.470
Malik Nabers, 165 yards, 29.50!

18
00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.088
Kenneth Walker, two touchdowns, 28.90!

19
00:01:11.168 --> 00:01:15.072
Trevor Lawrence, four touchdown passes in London, 28.34!

20
00:01:15.152 --> 00:01:20.955
One starter over 30. The league averaged 108.69. The smallest week of the season!

21
