25
00:01:36.704 --> 00:01:39.648
Swap those two, and Conor wins. Fewer Rams, Conor!

26
00:01:40.698 --> 00:01:42.490
An update from Half Chubb headquarters.

27
00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:46.196
Ian scored 77.94. The lowest score of the week.

28
00:01:46.276 --> 00:01:50.650
