29
00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:52.180
Ian is 1-5, and last.

30
00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:55.951
The sources had no comment. This robot is just reading the numbers.

31
00:01:57.001 --> 00:01:57.982
That's the whip-around!

32
00:01:58.062 --> 00:02:02.158
Tom is top of the table, 5-1, after winning by 0.38.

33
00:02:02.238 --> 00:02:04.329
Jack still leads the trade, by 4.40.

34
00:02:04.409 --> 00:02:05.924
